    "<div style=\"border:2px solid #6C8196; border-radius:12px; padding:18px 20px; margin-bottom:18px; background-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.08);\">\n",
    "\n",
    "  <div style=\"color:#6C8196; font-size:24px; font-weight:700; display:inline-block; border-bottom:3px solid #6C8196; padding-bottom:4px; margin-bottom:10px;\">\n",
    "    Final Model and Quality Score\n",
    "  </div>\n",
    "\n",
    "  <div style=\"color:#0D0A53; font-size:15px; line-height:1.8; margin-top:10px;\">\n",
    "    The final selected model was <code>Logistic Regression</code>. It was chosen after comparing several classification models using cross-validation on the training set, where it showed the strongest overall and most stable performance.\n",
    "    <br><br>\n",
    "    On the final test set, the model achieved the following quality scores:\n",
    "    <br><br>\n",
    "    - <span style=\"color:#2C5839; font-weight:600;\">AUC-ROC: 0.9544</span>\n",
    "    <br>\n",
    "    - <span style=\"color:#2C5839; font-weight:600;\">Accuracy: 0.9035</span>\n",
    "    <br><br>\n",
    "    These results are well above the highest project threshold and show that the final model can distinguish churned customers from active customers very effectively. This means the solution is not only technically successful, but also practically useful for helping Interconnect identify customers who may require retention efforts.\n",
    "  </div>\n",
    "\n",
    "  <div style=\"color:#2C5839; font-size:15px; line-height:1.7; margin-top:18px; padding-top:12px; border-top:1.5px solid #6C8196;\">\n",
    "    Result: Logistic Regression produced excellent predictive quality and became the final model for the task.\n",
    "  </div>\n",
    "\n",
    "</div>"
